WEBVTT

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:01.680
Who's there?

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:09.750
Secret Service Incognito's second 
in command, Variation-sama, correct?

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:10.860
Who are you?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.170
I was sent by Erec-sama.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:15.190
I've come to pick you up.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:27.450
We will be out of the the Ulga 
Sorority's sphere of influence soon.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:33.050
Within a few hours, we should be 
able to rendezvous with Erec-sama.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:36.470
Variation-sama?

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:40.160
Are you thinking about 
something in particular?

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.280
Yeah, a little bit about the past.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.350
Yes, that was before 
Incognito was formed...

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.710
What's wrong with you, punk?

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.940
You're only tough before 
things get going, or what?!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.360
You messed with the wrong guy!

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.110
Piss off.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:05.300
I'm earning my keep with 
my "face" here, too.

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:08.120
You think I'll just lose face 
without doing anything?!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.290
Bitch!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.750
I'd leave it at that.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.720
Huh? Who are you?

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.820
There's no need to put 
your life on the line

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:19.110
for a fight you started 
over trivial matters.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:22.130
Put that dangerous thing away.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.250
What?!

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:27.250
Hey, bro, what's the big idea?

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.020
There's nothing to gain by taking 
part in someone else's fight.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.520
Being meddlesome is just 
the way I was born.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:40.940
Oh yeah? Then you'll 
bite the dust first!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:44.920
Hey, watch your feet.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.410
Looks like it's slippery.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.560
Why you...

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.930
What about you? You wanna go?

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.290
You bastard...

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.640
Think twice.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:02.260
There's no need for us to fight.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:02.970
Shut up!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.550
I told you to not do it.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:10.480
Hmm, did you really say that?

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.960
I guess if you say you did, 
you probably did.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:24.530
So, what kind of meddlesome guy

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.830
wants anything to do with a 
meddlesome guy like me?

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:32.380
A head-on match, that's not bad, either.

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:35.900
I don't like beating around the bush.

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:41.460
Right now, the city is drowning in crime.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.670
Since the Alma Energy innovation,

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:46.840
along with the standard of living increasing

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.720
and the city's development flourishing,

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.350
it seems as if the people's 
lives are getting better.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.690
However, the people's hearts 
are not finding fulfillment

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.580
and the self-bred false 
pretenses are swallowing the city

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:03.080
along with despair.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:08.260
Crimes have become more brutal,
 and moral values are in the gutter.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.110
In the last few years,

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.370
the crime rate has 
soared like never before.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:19.260
Are you suggesting that a convenient 
world makes criminals more brutal?

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:24.630
We are working on reining in 
the criminals in this city.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.920
Oh, thank you.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.180
The noodles were good, 
I'll be coming back.

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:29.890
Thank you.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.280
Eventually, we'll be turning it 
into a nationwide organization.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.700
Right now we're laying 
the foundation for that.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:39.520
And?

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:43.710
We're looking for skilled 
and loyal people.

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:49.910
From the skill standpoint, 
you're a great match.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:54.540
How about it? Wanna try us out?

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:01.710
I've got an emotional scar 
that I can't talk about.

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.130
Your spot baldness?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.150
How did you know?!

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:09.680
I accidentally saw how you were 
worrying about it in the bathroom.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:13.320
Don't worry. I won't tell anyone.

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:14.730
Let's meet at the bureau tomorrow.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:17.970
This is it?

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:22.560
It's easier to meet them rather 
than trying to explain it here.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.250
So you're the new guy, huh?!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:30.120
Come on, he just arrived, 
so let's be nice, okay?

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.030
What?!

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:34.600
You trying to tell me that 
I did something wrong?!

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.710
No, that's not what I meant.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.330
Huh?! Huh?!

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.130
This is KT.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.260
The number one rowdy of 
our detective bureau.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.260
Nickname: Gori-san.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.340
This is Leon.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.960
The number one feeble guy here.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:55.190
He's called Denka because 
of his gentle demeanor.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.980
My favorite anime is 
<i>Legend of the Blue Wolves</i>.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.780
And lastly, our boss.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.610
I'm Erecpyle Dukakis. Nice to meet you.

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:09.290
I heard a lot about you from Yama-san.

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.410
I hear you're quite skilled.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:12.860
Yama-san?

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.240
That's me.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.410
I'm sure you already know,

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:20.140
but we're a special unit who 
stands up against crime.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.330
We're still just a small organization,

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:26.500
but I do want to take it to a 
national scale in the eventually.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:29.380
Yes, I've heard about that.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.940
Right now, we need people 
who are absolutely loyal.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.640
Do you have that quality?

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.390
I intend to prove myself worthy.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:44.900
I see. Then we need to give 
you a nickname, as well.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.610
Your nickname will be...

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:51.360
Spot Baldness.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.010
What the hell?!

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:57.520
I think I'll go make my rounds.

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.890
Hey! You said you'd keep that a secret!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.430
Well, you know...

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.630
Yes, Investigation Department here.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.290
What?!

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:08.650
Yes...

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.230
Yes...

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.390
Understood.

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.090
There's been an incident. 
Everybody, move out!

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:29.680
You've been surrounded.

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:31.400
Lay down your weapon and come out.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.230
Shut up!

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:37.230
The perp is a vicious criminal 
with two prior cases.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:39.500
You two move around to the back door.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.100
Spot Baldness and I will....

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:45.120
Damn it, is he lost already?!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.460
Don't shoot! 
I'm coming out with the perp!

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.920
Come on, walk already!

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:54.970
Mission accomplished.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:06.220
And thus, my new life began.

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:11.490
I solved case after case with them,

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:16.280
and their trust in me grew 
stronger and stronger.

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.970
However, I...

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:47.010
It looks like you successfully 
infiltrated them.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.520
Who do you think I am?

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.470
You're right.

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.580
So, what am I supposed to do there?

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:01.780
For now, just observe their movements 
and continue to report back.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:03.900
That's it?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.580
If there's anything else,
I'll let you know.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.180
Until then, don't let 
them get suspicious.

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:12.650
...I was a spy.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:18.260
I lived in the shadows, a professional 
agent who did anything for money.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:23.010
This time, I was hired by a mysterious 
person for an extraordinary sum.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.040
Yes, I was a traitor.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.280
Something wrong, Spot Baldness?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.210
You often seem kind of 
absentminded lately.

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:44.760
Is there something on your mind?

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:46.280
Not really.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:49.800
Let me know if you ever 
want to talk about it.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.840
If there's anything we can do 
to help, you can count on us.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.220
Roger.

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.590
By the way, about our next 
vacation, are you free?

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.430
It's actually a rather personal thing.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:06.660
You see, I'm getting married soon.

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:07.980
Married?

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.310
Yes. And before we get married,

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.100
I wanted to introduce my friends to her.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:13.710
Friend?

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.060
Me?

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:18.990
If you're busy, some other time is fine.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:22.810
I'll come.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:23.740
Really?

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:26.560
I'll definitely come. I promise!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.230
Thank you.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:30.330
That car!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:31.610
What is it?

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:34.340
That's the getaway car we got a report on!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.000
What?!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.720
Call the HQ!

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:37.430
Got it!

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.540
I'm off.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:45.780
Good work.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.100
I'm off, as well.

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.400
Okay, good work.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:52.520
Oh, wanna go have a drink?

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:55.550
No, I'm really off for the day.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:59.530
I see, 'til tomorrow then.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.050
I'm...

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.460
We did it!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.250
Everybody, we did it! We finally did it!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.740
What's up, boss?

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:50.410
We did it!

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.780
We have finally secured our funding.

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:55.070
Really?

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:57.650
Are you sure it's not some 
sort of scam like always?

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.640
This time it's real.

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:01.380
An organization that understands...

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.420
I believe they're called 
the Ulga Sorority.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:07.260
We'll be generously funded by them.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:11.180
Now we can take our operation 
to a nationwide level!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.060
You did it, boss.

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:16.470
This is all thanks to the hard 
work you put in every day.

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:18.250
For that, I thank you.

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:20.480
Stop it boss.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.190
I'm not good at handling 
that kind of stuff.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:24.040
Yeah, really.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:29.720
You're the one who was always 
leading and pulling us forward.

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:32.200
Then how about we all go have a drink?

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:33.830
That sounds good!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.230
Oh yeah!

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.700
Let's drink until we get diarrhea!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.840
Then the usual spot, at eight.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.760
Hey now, if we're all drunk,

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.880
who's supposed to uphold 
the peace in the city?

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.590
That's what I'd usually say, 
but today's special!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.170
Let's go wild!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:58.650
Oh yeah, we also need a new name, 
so please think of something.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:03.090
What am I supposed to do?

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.960
Hey, looks like it's going well.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.270
I guess so.

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:13.660
What's wrong?

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.550
You look like someone at a wake.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.270
You've got a mission.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:21.710
And?

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.570
Your order is to assassinate 
your boss, Erecpyle.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.150
Should I erase him?

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:30.370
You can pick your methods.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.960
You've got one week from tomorrow. 
You can do it, right?

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.130
Who sent the order?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.550
We agreed that you wouldn't ask.

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:44.830
In this world, trust is everything.

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:48.110
The important thing is 
loyalty towards your work.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:51.980
I've passed on your 
orders, Spot Baldness.

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:56.660
Best of luck.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:03.350
Hiding from the rain, as well?

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.320
Faced with this important choice,

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.240
I was distressed over the 
future of my two selves.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:18.240
Should I stick to my work as a professional?

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.330
Or do I respond to the new trust

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:23.810
in like fashion, and throw
 my entire past away?

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:29.150
I envy you for your simple life.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:37.950
Yes, Investigation Department here.

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:39.720
What?!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:41.920
Understood!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.600
There's a bank robbery at 
the St. Piria bank on 3rd.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:50.720
An armed group has taken hostages 
and has holed up in there.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.140
A robbery?! I'll show them!

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:56.060
All right, let's move out!

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:58.530
Today I'll go with you.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.130
Let's move.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:01.260
Are you sure?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.410
Please don't lose it out 
there after so long.

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:07.070
We just got a generous sponsor.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.030
I have to show off a little.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.630
Hey, Spot Baldness! Move it!

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:15.990
Sorry.

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:20.330
<i>We finished cordoning off the area.</i>

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.170
<i>The robbers are demanding 
a helicopter to get away.</i>

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.380
<i>They're saying they'll kill a hostage</i>

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.010
<i>every five minutes if we don't comply!</i>

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:31.230
We were stationed on the second floor 
of the building across the street.

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:32.590
Yes.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:34.190
Yes.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:35.800
What?!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:39.960
It'll take 15 minutes until the 
army's special unit arrives.

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:42.350
Everybody, please put on 
your bulletproof vests.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.610
This is the blueprint of the bank.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.770
According to the hostages 
that were already freed,

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:51.210
the rest of the hostages are being 
held in this room on the first floor.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.850
The robbers are split between 
the first and second floors.

00:16:55.850 --> 00:16:57.480
We know of nine members in their group.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:17:00.510
However, there is a chance 
that there are more of them.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.650
What about the third and fourth floors?

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:05.730
They are empty, but the 
stairs are barricaded

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:07.160
so we can't get in there.

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:10.780
Gori-san, please assist us with 
your rifle from this building.

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:11.630
Roger.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.940
Us four will descend 
from the roof with ropes

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.350
and enter from the windows 
on the second floor.

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:19.800
Denka and Yama-san will take 
care of the first floor,

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.640
Spot Baldness and I will take 
care of the second floor.

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.700
Gori here, I am in position.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:27.400
<i>Roger.</i>

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.550
Assault team in position on the roof.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:32.070
Fire tear gas in two minutes.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:32.660
<i>Roger!</i>

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.150
Yama-san and Denka please 
descend from the north side.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.430
Spot Baldness and I will 
enter from the south side.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.160
Roger!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:45.980
Are you ready?

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:46.900
Yes.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:49.130
Yama-san, how about you?

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:50.550
<i>We're ready.</i>

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:53.050
All right, commencing mission.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:54.760
Fire!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.500
Stop screaming!

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.680
Damn, they're going to come in!

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:06.190
Please follow me in two seconds.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:07.850
I'm entrusting my back to you!

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:08.310
Boss!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.460
Damn it! In that case, 
I'll take you down with me!

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.800
Please don't shoot.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.630
Open the safe already!

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.470
We know that you're keeping 
an Alma Crystal in there!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:46.710
It's the second room from the right.

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.340
Just shoot, five shots.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.820
Don't move or—

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.230
Marvelous.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.200
It's over.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.360
The hostages have all 
been freed, as well.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.140
The manager is fine as we...

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.550
He's fine.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.400
He just passed out after 
the immense pressure

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.750
was lifted from his shoulders.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.810
So our mission's complete.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.780
Good work, everybody.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.900
It looks like you saved my life.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.020
No need to thank me.

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:40.980
After all, I'm going to kill you now.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:43.330
What do you mean?

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.020
I was a spy from the beginning.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:50.080
I was to infiltrate your ranks 
and spy on your movements.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.100
In the beginning it was just 
an infiltration mission.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:56.840
But last night, I got 
the kill order for you.

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:00.510
That's why you're going to kill me?

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.690
I can't betray the trust of my client.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:07.350
And? You won't have any regrets?

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.740
Even if I do, there's nothing 
I can do about that.

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:14.860
Any last words?

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.740
Do you have a good name?

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.490
For our organization.

00:20:26.470 --> 00:20:27.920
Incognito.

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:30.980
Incognito...

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.580
Anonymous, huh?

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.760
That might be a fitting 
name for our organization.

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.260
Then...

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:43.110
Hold it!

00:20:44.190 --> 00:20:46.450
You just got punk'd!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:51.100
Punk'd?!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:58.440
You're my client's messenger.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.410
It was actually me.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.350
Denka...

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.280
The client was actually our boss.

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:09.320
We're looking for skilled people 
with exceptional loyalty.

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:11.330
And we found you.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:17.960
You passed the test. 
Spot Baldness, congratulations!

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:23.970
Congratulations, Spot Baldness... 
Baldness... Baldy...

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.720
What the hell?!

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:36.440
And that's how the Secret 
Service Incognito was born.

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:39.980
What?

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:42.650
Um, everybody's totally different...

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.840
And you never even 
appeared on the scene.

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:49.240
Weren't you listening to my story?

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.540
I was there, from the very beginning.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:52.690
Huh?

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:53.370
See?

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.100
<i>I'd leave it at that.</i>

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:57.620
What?!

00:21:58.040 --> 00:21:59.240
What the hell?

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:01.040
No matter how blind you are, 
that's totally someone else!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.950
This story doesn't check out!

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:05.510
Everybody was so mischievous back then.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:08.380
There were shots at 
the end, four of them!

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:10.040
What happened there?!

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:13.000
People have pasts that they 
don't want to touch again.

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.130
You understand, right? Right?

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:15.940
Not a single bit!

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:18.430
And then the morning sun rose. Period.

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:20.230
Period? What period?!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:23.850
Wait, that's the episode?! What is this?

00:22:23.850 --> 00:22:26.920
Aren't we nearing our final episode?!

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:30.590
What the hell is this? 
Seriously, explain it to me!

00:22:30.590 --> 00:22:34.430
What is this crap?!

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:14.190
Jugglaburk has finally started 
moving his armies towards St. Piria.

00:24:14.190 --> 00:24:17.870
We rush to the battlefield to 
prevent the worst from happening,

00:24:17.870 --> 00:24:21.690
but then I see the Death 
Omen Star in the skies.

00:24:21.690 --> 00:24:24.530
Wait, is this the hero dies flag?!

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:30.070
The war is about to begin and 
Kon gets the hero dies flag!

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:30.070
Wait a sec, does this world even 
have the "Death Omen Star"?!

00:24:30.070 --> 00:24:35.210
Today's content might 
have a lot of issues,

00:24:30.070 --> 00:24:35.210
but please just accept it 
for what it was. (What?)
